HEAD: bd2278c (feature/editor-ux), exported with `git archive bd2278c` (clean tree); this log and the T71 doc changes are added afterwards (docs only)
Image: mcr.microsoft.com/playwright:v1.63.0-noble (linux/arm64 on Docker Desktop, engine 29.8.1); @playwright/test 1.63.0
Node used for the runs: v22.23.3 (the same nodejs.org linux-arm64 tarball as T67, checked against SHASUMS256.txt, copied to /opt/node22, first on PATH;
  the image's own Node is not used). Inside the repo's engines (>=22.18 <23). pnpm 10.25.0 via corepack.
Docker CLI: static 27.3.1 aarch64 from download.docker.com (the T67 download).
How (the T53/T58/T63/T67 harness): repo copy in the container, `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`, `pnpm exec prisma generate`, then plain `CI=1 pnpm test:e2e`
  (no --workers flag, so the config's 2 workers). Docker socket mounted from the host, TESTCONTAINERS_HOST_OVERRIDE=host.docker.internal
  (--add-host=host.docker.internal:host-gateway), TESTCONTAINERS_RYUK_DISABLED=true (local only). The app server and its throwaway Postgres come from
  playwright.config.ts's webServer. .env = env.example with generated AUTH/CRON/LIMIT_KEY secrets and a dummy Sentry DSN; never the repo's .env databases.
  The host was kept awake with `caffeinate -i` for the whole run.

